(4116816, 591651, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a cool looking tunnel! I think this could benefit from a bit more contrast, a bit of noise reduction and then change it to B&amp;W....that would really make it pop. But I love all the curves in this and it fits the challenge well.</td>', 'What a cool looking tunnel! I think this could benefit from a bit more contrast, a bit of noise reduction and then change it to B&W....that would really make it pop. But I love all the curves in this and it fits the challenge well.', '2007-09-26 09:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4116821, 591818, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely scenery, very interesting. It is a bit tilted, you can easily fix that. The railing (I think it''s a railing) at the front really doesn''t do anything for the photo, though, shooting beyond that or cropping it out would really improve this photo.</td>', 'Lovely scenery, very interesting. It is a bit tilted, you can easily fix that. The railing (I think it''s a railing) at the front really doesn''t do anything for the photo, though, shooting beyond that or cropping it out would really improve this photo.', '2007-09-26 09:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4116822, 591690, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely clear image. Nice sky, but I am not sure that s-curve is leading the viewer through the photo.</td>', 'Lovely clear image. Nice sky, but I am not sure that s-curve is leading the viewer through the photo.', '2007-09-26 09:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4116823, 591821, 43774, '<td valign="top">Aw, cute dogs. Unfortunately I don''t see much of an s-curve and even if I could stretch my mind and make them into an s-curve the photo is not quite in focus.</td>', 'Aw, cute dogs. Unfortunately I don''t see much of an s-curve and even if I could stretch my mind and make them into an s-curve the photo is not quite in focus.', '2007-09-26 09:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
