(4117525, 590617, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  Definitely one of my top picks.</td>', 'Very nicely done!  Definitely one of my top picks.', '2007-09-26 13:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117548, 591736, 78303, '<td valign="top">I like how ou took what coudl be a cliche (the road curving) and added the visual appeal of the barn at the end of the road, framed by the trees.  Very nice.</td>', 'I like how ou took what coudl be a cliche (the road curving) and added the visual appeal of the barn at the end of the road, framed by the trees.  Very nice.', '2007-09-26 13:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117552, 591569, 78303, '<td valign="top">I do see the S, but it is too bad the lighting was battling against you.  It just looks a little "blah"</td>', 'I do see the S, but it is too bad the lighting was battling against you.  It just looks a little "blah"', '2007-09-26 13:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117565, 591655, 78303, '<td valign="top">I am looking for, but not seeing, the S curves in this.  The horizon is a little askew also.  I do like the picture and the location.  The lighting is very nice.</td>', 'I am looking for, but not seeing, the S curves in this.  The horizon is a little askew also.  I do like the picture and the location.  The lighting is very nice.', '2007-09-26 13:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117574, 591162, 84440, '<td valign="top">Great subject. The problem comes from distracting elements in the frame. The photo could also be improved by greater DOF, in my opinion. The body going oof is not bad ( although the halo over the back is distracting ), but the nose and mouth need to be in focus to really get my attention. Nice catch but try for more OOF next time. The best way to control this is by shooting in Aperture priority. Raising the ISO might have also helped.</td>', 'Great subject. The problem comes from distracting elements in the frame. The photo could also be improved by greater DOF, in my opinion. The body going oof is not bad ( although the halo over the back is distracting ), but the nose and mouth need to be in focus to really get my attention. Nice catch but try for more OOF next time. The best way to control this is by shooting in Aperture priority. Raising the ISO might have also helped.', '2007-09-26 13:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117576, 590122, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2007-09-26 13:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117577, 590528, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nice darkness and mystery!</td>', 'Nice darkness and mystery!', '2007-09-26 13:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117586, 590577, 84440, '<td valign="top">Highlights are distracting. The idea of a spot of color again the green with the holder leading the eye there is basically a good composition. However, problems for me are that the stand center is not vertical and that I want to see nice detail in the flower. Even if the flower is small it should show detail and definition. Even bright red, it gets lost in the bright background highlights. The bright oof object on the end of the black bar is also distracting.</td>', 'Highlights are distracting. The idea of a spot of color again the green with the holder leading the eye there is basically a good composition. However, problems for me are that the stand center is not vertical and that I want to see nice detail in the flower. Even if the flower is small it should show detail and definition. Even bright red, it gets lost in the bright background highlights. The bright oof object on the end of the black bar is also distracting.', '2007-09-26 14:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117589, 591317, 84440, '<td valign="top">Humerous! nice sky but the effect doesn''t work well for me.</td>', 'Humerous! nice sky but the effect doesn''t work well for me.', '2007-09-26 14:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117594, 590132, 84440, '<td valign="top">nice scene. doesn''t quite work for me. Better light would help, maybe in morning versus evening or opposite.</td>', 'nice scene. doesn''t quite work for me. Better light would help, maybe in morning versus evening or opposite.', '2007-09-26 14:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117599, 590887, 84440, '<td valign="top">appears dark on my monitor, maybe a little curves could open this up without spot editing.</td>', 'appears dark on my monitor, maybe a little curves could open this up without spot editing.', '2007-09-26 14:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4117608, 590345, 60698, '<td valign="top">Pretty sky. Nice clarity on the subject!</td>', 'Pretty sky. Nice clarity on the subject!', '2007-09-26 14:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
