(4117656, 591168, 84656, '<td valign="top">I like the interpretation.  Striking colours.  Image seems a bit soft though, and the table/stand at the bottom of the image is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the interpretation.  Striking colours.  Image seems a bit soft though, and the table/stand at the bottom of the image is a bit distracting.', '2007-09-26 14:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
