(4119895, 591343, 39679, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it was intentional but your image has a lot of noise.  To be honest, I actually like it on the derailer itself but it''s pretty distracting in the background.  I''d love to see you do this image, again, with a cleaner back ground but maintaining the noise on the derailer itself.</td>', 'I''m not sure if it was intentional but your image has a lot of noise.  To be honest, I actually like it on the derailer itself but it''s pretty distracting in the background.  I''d love to see you do this image, again, with a cleaner back ground but maintaining the noise on the derailer itself.', '2007-09-27 11:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119920, 591655, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice sunset.  That said, the concept of the s-curve is a device that leads the viewer''s eye either through the image or to the subject.   I''m not getting either in this (very nice) shot.  Your subject, the intersection of the sunset and the rock''s silhouette, is so strong as to take control of the image.<br/> <br/>Please don''t think I''m just ragging your shot.  It really is a great shot.  I''m just not getting the challenge from it.</td>', 'This is a really nice sunset.  That said, the concept of the s-curve is a device that leads the viewer''s eye either through the image or to the subject.   I''m not getting either in this (very nice) shot.  Your subject, the intersection of the sunset and the rock''s silhouette, is so strong as to take control of the image. Please don''t think I''m just ragging your shot.  It really is a great shot.  I''m just not getting the challenge from it.', '2007-09-27 11:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4119958, 591148, 39679, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful shot and I voted well for it.  That said, the challenge isn''t strongly represented in your shot and I would have voted better for it if the challenge were more prominent in your shot.</td>', 'this is a beautiful shot and I voted well for it.  That said, the challenge isn''t strongly represented in your shot and I would have voted better for it if the challenge were more prominent in your shot.', '2007-09-27 11:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
