(4120443, 590352, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos that warms the heart (being a dad anyway).  Well captured in all of the technical details and composition.  The ''S'' is a tad short (funny how the eyes complete what''s not there) but I''m not holding that against you (much) - gave this an 8 initially and coming back around for comments.</td>', 'This is one of those photos that warms the heart (being a dad anyway).  Well captured in all of the technical details and composition.  The ''S'' is a tad short (funny how the eyes complete what''s not there) but I''m not holding that against you (much) - gave this an 8 initially and coming back around for comments.', '2007-09-27 15:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
