(4120446, 590297, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very interesting abstract take on the challenge that is quite well done.  Nice lighting technique.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very interesting abstract take on the challenge that is quite well done.  Nice lighting technique.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-09-27 15:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4120447, 591736, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The vivid colors of the scene with the filtered sunlight is very nice, and the fading fog around the corner is cool too.  Well seen and captured!  Good luck.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The vivid colors of the scene with the filtered sunlight is very nice, and the fading fog around the corner is cool too.  Well seen and captured!  Good luck.', '2007-09-27 15:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4120448, 591572, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Fire sure changed the overall feel of this landscape I imagine.  The haze in the distance makes it seem like it''s still smoldering and the fire consumed the entire valley!  I like how you controlled the exposure to keep the glare on the road from blowing out.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow.  Fire sure changed the overall feel of this landscape I imagine.  The haze in the distance makes it seem like it''s still smoldering and the fire consumed the entire valley!  I like how you controlled the exposure to keep the glare on the road from blowing out.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-09-27 15:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4120449, 590887, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the overall feel of this photo.  Nice scenic view with a dramatic sky.  The ''S'' is there, but not easily discerned for those that don''t look closely (that''s probably going to cost your score a little).  FWIW, I like it - 7 from me earlier.  Coming back around to comment.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the overall feel of this photo.  Nice scenic view with a dramatic sky.  The ''S'' is there, but not easily discerned for those that don''t look closely (that''s probably going to cost your score a little).  FWIW, I like it - 7 from me earlier.  Coming back around to comment.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-09-27 15:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4120450, 591168, 84363, '<td valign="top">Photo is out of focus and colors seem to be a little off.  Although I do like the idea of the subject matter.</td>', 'Photo is out of focus and colors seem to be a little off.  Although I do like the idea of the subject matter.', '2007-09-27 15:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4120456, 591723, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s almost like someone plastered a ''S'' right out there for you!  :)  Great idea getting this shot at night.  Much better than anything this could have done in daylight, although twilight may have been pretty strong as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s almost like someone plastered a ''S'' right out there for you!  :)  Great idea getting this shot at night.  Much better than anything this could have done in daylight, although twilight may have been pretty strong as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-09-27 15:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
