(4120466, 590936, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice POV for this.  It''s kind of fun how the letter ''S'' appears in the fields to the left also.  As for the challenge, you''ve captured a leading ''S'' that works pretty well.  Might have warmed this up just a touch to get some of the blue cast off the far hillside.  Little haloing in the tree reflection on the water (HDR or Clarify?).  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice POV for this.  It''s kind of fun how the letter ''S'' appears in the fields to the left also.  As for the challenge, you''ve captured a leading ''S'' that works pretty well.  Might have warmed this up just a touch to get some of the blue cast off the far hillside.  Little haloing in the tree reflection on the water (HDR or Clarify?).  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-09-27 15:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
