(4120773, 591542, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is such a nice shot and I really see what you wanted to do.  However, the road stops before it completely brings the eye to your subject (the mountain).  As a result, the S-curve almost appears as an accident rather than a purposeful compositional tool.<br/> <br/>All that said, this is still a wonderful shot.</td>', 'This is such a nice shot and I really see what you wanted to do.  However, the road stops before it completely brings the eye to your subject (the mountain).  As a result, the S-curve almost appears as an accident rather than a purposeful compositional tool. All that said, this is still a wonderful shot.', '2007-09-27 18:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
