(4121593, 590135, 84465, '<td valign="top">wow, ive been looking at these pictures for a while and this one really stands out to me.  I like it alot.  It fits the challenge perfectly, where some of the other shots i''ve looked at haven''t really filled the s-curve genre.  Good exposure, good composition.  I also love train pictures.  I also like the smoke stack, it adds another demision to the shot.  The only things i have issues with could be fixed in photoshop.  It needs to be sharpened a little more, and i think the saturation should be turned up a little more and it would really bring out the color on the train and the leaves.  Great shot</td>', 'wow, ive been looking at these pictures for a while and this one really stands out to me.  I like it alot.  It fits the challenge perfectly, where some of the other shots i''ve looked at haven''t really filled the s-curve genre.  Good exposure, good composition.  I also love train pictures.  I also like the smoke stack, it adds another demision to the shot.  The only things i have issues with could be fixed in photoshop.  It needs to be sharpened a little more, and i think the saturation should be turned up a little more and it would really bring out the color on the train and the leaves.  Great shot', '2007-09-28 01:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
