(4122114, 591759, 53147, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but lacks any real wow power. I wonder if it would have stood out better had it been in color rather than the b&amp;w.</td>', 'Meets the challenge but lacks any real wow power. I wonder if it would have stood out better had it been in color rather than the b&w.', '2007-09-28 10:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122117, 591317, 53147, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but lacks any oomph. Cropping it so the sign was the same distance from the edge on the top, bottom and left could have helped some, but overall it just doesnt have the wow power needed for me.</td>', 'Meets the challenge but lacks any oomph. Cropping it so the sign was the same distance from the edge on the top, bottom and left could have helped some, but overall it just doesnt have the wow power needed for me.', '2007-09-28 10:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122122, 591403, 53147, '<td valign="top">While you met the challenge this image just feels a bit flat to me. I am not digging the crop on the mouse or the grain on the cord.</td>', 'While you met the challenge this image just feels a bit flat to me. I am not digging the crop on the mouse or the grain on the cord.', '2007-09-28 10:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122126, 591378, 53147, '<td valign="top">You have an interesting location but the image itself feels a bit flat. Nothing dynamic about it to make me want to hang out longer to view.</td>', 'You have an interesting location but the image itself feels a bit flat. Nothing dynamic about it to make me want to hang out longer to view.', '2007-09-28 10:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122127, 591202, 53147, '<td valign="top">Meets tha challenge but overall just has a snapshot kind of feel to it.</td>', 'Meets tha challenge but overall just has a snapshot kind of feel to it.', '2007-09-28 10:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122130, 591560, 53147, '<td valign="top">I am guessing the tongue is the s curve? Normally I like cat shots but this one just doesnt grab me.</td>', 'I am guessing the tongue is the s curve? Normally I like cat shots but this one just doesnt grab me.', '2007-09-28 10:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122133, 591585, 53147, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge for sure but the image just doesnt have anything in the composition that grabs my attention.</td>', 'Meets the challenge for sure but the image just doesnt have anything in the composition that grabs my attention.', '2007-09-28 10:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122135, 589947, 53147, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge for sure but overall this image just feels lacking. THere just doesnt seem to bee anything that draws the image together or have a strong point of interest.</td>', 'Meets the challenge for sure but overall this image just feels lacking. THere just doesnt seem to bee anything that draws the image together or have a strong point of interest.', '2007-09-28 10:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122138, 591786, 53147, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but really lacks any pop or power. Heavier processing may have made this image stand out a bit better.</td>', 'Meets the challenge but really lacks any pop or power. Heavier processing may have made this image stand out a bit better.', '2007-09-28 10:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122140, 591801, 53147, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but doesnt stand out strong in it. Pictures of statues really need something extra to make them stand out. This just feels like a quick shot of a statue.</td>', 'Meets the challenge but doesnt stand out strong in it. Pictures of statues really need something extra to make them stand out. This just feels like a quick shot of a statue.', '2007-09-28 10:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122143, 591230, 53147, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge and I do like the angle but the overall image just falls a bit flat. I think this image could handle some heavier duty processing and make it more "artistic".</td>', 'Meets the challenge and I do like the angle but the overall image just falls a bit flat. I think this image could handle some heavier duty processing and make it more "artistic".', '2007-09-28 10:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122148, 591569, 53147, '<td valign="top">Odd looking creature for sure. The background really detracts from your model.</td>', 'Odd looking creature for sure. The background really detracts from your model.', '2007-09-28 10:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122149, 590887, 53147, '<td valign="top">Good general image but seems a bit too soft focused through out. This may have held up well with a stronger tonemapping kind of processing.</td>', 'Good general image but seems a bit too soft focused through out. This may have held up well with a stronger tonemapping kind of processing.', '2007-09-28 10:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122152, 591461, 53147, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but just feels a bit flat and boring.</td>', 'Meets the challenge but just feels a bit flat and boring.', '2007-09-28 10:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122291, 591097, 79335, '<td valign="top">i don''t see an S-curve :(</td>', 'i don''t see an S-curve :(', '2007-09-28 11:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122353, 590224, 4517, '<td valign="top">Terrific ir shot, great looking sky and very nice tone of blue. Wish this was mine :)  10</td>', 'Terrific ir shot, great looking sky and very nice tone of blue. Wish this was mine :)  10', '2007-09-28 12:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122373, 589166, 79335, '<td valign="top">great picture, but doesn''t really fit to the challenge -&gt; 6</td>', 'great picture, but doesn''t really fit to the challenge -> 6', '2007-09-28 12:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122375, 589754, 79335, '<td valign="top">really blurry!</td>', 'really blurry!', '2007-09-28 12:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122458, 590596, 68514, '<td valign="top">Very nice, maybe with more contrast and a human presence it could be very very nice :)</td>', 'Very nice, maybe with more contrast and a human presence it could be very very nice :)', '2007-09-28 13:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122594, 590224, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has wonderful tones to it, although I''ll admit I''m not a fan of IR as it looks too unnatural.  I''m not really sure that the ''S'' is evident enough to score highly on the challenge connection.</td>', 'This has wonderful tones to it, although I''ll admit I''m not a fan of IR as it looks too unnatural.  I''m not really sure that the ''S'' is evident enough to score highly on the challenge connection.', '2007-09-28 14:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122595, 589398, 30049, '<td valign="top">He-he.  Made me laugh.  If it''s more of a ''D'' curve, then why did you enter it in an ''S'' challenge?  It''s a pretty scene and I like the starburst.  Bit too much of a stretch for me on meeting the challenge, no matter how honest you are in your title.  :)</td>', 'He-he.  Made me laugh.  If it''s more of a ''D'' curve, then why did you enter it in an ''S'' challenge?  It''s a pretty scene and I like the starburst.  Bit too much of a stretch for me on meeting the challenge, no matter how honest you are in your title.  :)', '2007-09-28 14:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122602, 591479, 30049, '<td valign="top">A nice stock type photo for this particular vehicle I suppose.  While the ''S'' is nice it''s not what this challenge is about IMO.  It''s supposed to be a leading line that takes the viewer thru the image, not just a letter ''S''.</td>', 'A nice stock type photo for this particular vehicle I suppose.  While the ''S'' is nice it''s not what this challenge is about IMO.  It''s supposed to be a leading line that takes the viewer thru the image, not just a letter ''S''.', '2007-09-28 15:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122607, 591655, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very pretty scene, and I imagine there''s an ''S'' in there somewhere, but I''m not seeing it.  Looks like your horizon is tilted a bit to the right.  :P  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very pretty scene, and I imagine there''s an ''S'' in there somewhere, but I''m not seeing it.  Looks like your horizon is tilted a bit to the right.  :P  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-09-28 15:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122613, 591685, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice emotive image.  I like the tone and composition in general.  Not quite sure of the connection to the challenge.  If I understand this challenge correctly, it''s supposed to be a leading line that takes the viewer thru the image, not just a letter ''S''.  Hmmm, nonetheless, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice emotive image.  I like the tone and composition in general.  Not quite sure of the connection to the challenge.  If I understand this challenge correctly, it''s supposed to be a leading line that takes the viewer thru the image, not just a letter ''S''.  Hmmm, nonetheless, good luck in the challenge.', '2007-09-28 15:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122621, 591710, 30049, '<td valign="top">Pleasing image with a nice ''S'' (slight) curve to lead the viewer thru the image.  Hooray!  I like the overall composition of this with the subject fence hooking up with another that horizontally bisects the image near the upper third line.   Makes for a nice balance.  Appears you waited for a good time of day, in regards to lighting, to capture this shot.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Pleasing image with a nice ''S'' (slight) curve to lead the viewer thru the image.  Hooray!  I like the overall composition of this with the subject fence hooking up with another that horizontally bisects the image near the upper third line.   Makes for a nice balance.  Appears you waited for a good time of day, in regards to lighting, to capture this shot.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-09-28 15:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122622, 590135, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well done.  We have a ''S'' curve that leads us into the image and to a worthy subject.  The smoke helps to make this shot, without that it wouldn''t be as dynamic.  Nicely seen and captured.  Good luck.</td>', 'Well done.  We have a ''S'' curve that leads us into the image and to a worthy subject.  The smoke helps to make this shot, without that it wouldn''t be as dynamic.  Nicely seen and captured.  Good luck.', '2007-09-28 15:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122624, 591209, 30049, '<td valign="top">Quit picking on the bugs would''ya?!  :)  These are so colorful, but doomed if found in OUR garden.  I like the "pose" you''ve caught here.  While your ''S'' curve isn''t a strong leading line with a sense of moving the viewer thru the image, I think it still works because of the proximity of the subject and how it fills the frame.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Quit picking on the bugs would''ya?!  :)  These are so colorful, but doomed if found in OUR garden.  I like the "pose" you''ve caught here.  While your ''S'' curve isn''t a strong leading line with a sense of moving the viewer thru the image, I think it still works because of the proximity of the subject and how it fills the frame.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-09-28 15:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122660, 591723, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your image, but Im curious if it was flipped horizontally. The road sign appears to be backwards. Good composition and meets the challenge well in my opinion. Good luck.</td>', 'I like your image, but Im curious if it was flipped horizontally. The road sign appears to be backwards. Good composition and meets the challenge well in my opinion. Good luck.', '2007-09-28 15:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122662, 591479, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of your image and the red really "pops" This would be great for advertising.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of your image and the red really "pops" This would be great for advertising.', '2007-09-28 15:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122700, 589747, 30049, '<td valign="top">This scene is nice and has more potential than is captured here IMO.  I say that because of the lighting.  Appears to be midday or maybe it''s just overcast, but there''s nothing dynamic about the lighting.  Seems a little flat.<br/> <br/>The ''S'' you''ve captured works well for the challenge, although it''s not as strong a component to the photo as I think the challenge intended (to lead the viewer thru the image).<br/> <br/>If this was cropped to only half, eliminating the upper half, and taken with some still water and reflections - maybe some early morning light with a little steam rising...???  Just a thought.<br/> <br/>As is, I think the image is fairly strong to the theme, and I like that you didn''t just find some literal ''S'' to photograph.  And as a photo it''s fine, but in more of a snapshot sense rather than an artistic one.<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This scene is nice and has more potential than is captured here IMO.  I say that because of the lighting.  Appears to be midday or maybe it''s just overcast, but there''s nothing dynamic about the lighting.  Seems a little flat. The ''S'' you''ve captured works well for the challenge, although it''s not as strong a component to the photo as I think the challenge intended (to lead the viewer thru the image). If this was cropped to only half, eliminating the upper half, and taken with some still water and reflections - maybe some early morning light with a little steam rising...???  Just a thought. As is, I think the image is fairly strong to the theme, and I like that you didn''t just find some literal ''S'' to photograph.  And as a photo it''s fine, but in more of a snapshot sense rather than an artistic one. Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-09-28 16:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122705, 590577, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has a little too much going on (busy) IMO and the ''S'' doesn''t do anything to help the photo.  It''s just kind of there in the background (if the ''S'' is the shepherds hook).  Ideally, the ''S'' curve would be a gentle leading line to take the viewer thru the image.<br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  :) Good luck.</td>', 'This has a little too much going on (busy) IMO and the ''S'' doesn''t do anything to help the photo.  It''s just kind of there in the background (if the ''S'' is the shepherds hook).  Ideally, the ''S'' curve would be a gentle leading line to take the viewer thru the image. All JMO of course.  :) Good luck.', '2007-09-28 16:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122711, 591511, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a pleasant photo.  Fun to look at and I like the way the balloon is taking the upper-left corner compositionally.  As for the challenge connection - I''m not seeing it.  Sorry if it''s not obvious to me and I''m missing it.  My understanding of the challenge is to have a ''S'' curve that leads the viewer thru the image.  I honestly can''t see that here.<br/> <br/>JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a pleasant photo.  Fun to look at and I like the way the balloon is taking the upper-left corner compositionally.  As for the challenge connection - I''m not seeing it.  Sorry if it''s not obvious to me and I''m missing it.  My understanding of the challenge is to have a ''S'' curve that leads the viewer thru the image.  I honestly can''t see that here. JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-09-28 16:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4122718, 591285, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image.  I really like the mystery that the fog adds to the overall feel.  The ''S'' curve is right on the mark and meets the challenge very well.   Well seen and captured!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image.  I really like the mystery that the fog adds to the overall feel.  The ''S'' curve is right on the mark and meets the challenge very well.   Well seen and captured!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-09-28 16:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
