(4124010, 589166, 83805, '<td valign="top">Hummmm I like the shot, but don''t see the S...</td>', 'Hummmm I like the shot, but don''t see the S...', '2007-09-29 07:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124011, 591651, 83805, '<td valign="top">Let me assure you... thats a long walk for a man too!</td>', 'Let me assure you... thats a long walk for a man too!', '2007-09-29 07:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124013, 591695, 83805, '<td valign="top">Its a neat composition, but I''m finding it a bit harsh.... just a little too much contrast perhaps.</td>', 'Its a neat composition, but I''m finding it a bit harsh.... just a little too much contrast perhaps.', '2007-09-29 07:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124014, 591583, 83805, '<td valign="top">Cool... but - humans like subjects :)</td>', 'Cool... but - humans like subjects :)', '2007-09-29 07:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124018, 590355, 83805, '<td valign="top">Its a little flat, nothings really popping out at me, I think you could make this better with a little consideration on lighting, and composition, try not to rely on cropping so much :)</td>', 'Its a little flat, nothings really popping out at me, I think you could make this better with a little consideration on lighting, and composition, try not to rely on cropping so much :)', '2007-09-29 07:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124025, 591560, 70000, '<td valign="top">what a unique photo!</td>', 'what a unique photo!', '2007-09-29 07:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124026, 591592, 70000, '<td valign="top">the colors here seem a bit force, maybe this would have been more effective as a black and white</td>', 'the colors here seem a bit force, maybe this would have been more effective as a black and white', '2007-09-29 07:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124028, 591652, 70000, '<td valign="top">beautiful location doesn''t really have a focal point for me though</td>', 'beautiful location doesn''t really have a focal point for me though', '2007-09-29 07:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124094, 589949, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the lighting and the perspective of foreground, midground, and beyond.  I might''ve tried cropping the sky much closer to the mountaintops to draw more attention to where the road leads into the landscape.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the lighting and the perspective of foreground, midground, and beyond.  I might''ve tried cropping the sky much closer to the mountaintops to draw more attention to where the road leads into the landscape.', '2007-09-29 08:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124154, 591737, 70000, '<td valign="top">good job keeping the detail in the dark parts even when it should have sillhouetted, I think you could have left in a little more shadow though</td>', 'good job keeping the detail in the dark parts even when it should have sillhouetted, I think you could have left in a little more shadow though', '2007-09-29 10:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124281, 590122, 84440, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried to figure out what bothers me about this one. The angle is good, the track s shape is interesting. The smoke is nice ( although I''d like to see more of it ). I think the problem for me is that the photo seems slightly blurred. To me the photo should either be tack sharp or shot with a slow shutter speed to show motion in the train. This photo seems to be somewhere in between and just doesn''t have impact in my opinion.</td>', 'I''ve tried to figure out what bothers me about this one. The angle is good, the track s shape is interesting. The smoke is nice ( although I''d like to see more of it ). I think the problem for me is that the photo seems slightly blurred. To me the photo should either be tack sharp or shot with a slow shutter speed to show motion in the train. This photo seems to be somewhere in between and just doesn''t have impact in my opinion.', '2007-09-29 11:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124400, 591738, 66384, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit over sharpened to me. I like your curve though.</td>', 'This looks a bit over sharpened to me. I like your curve though.', '2007-09-29 14:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124402, 591710, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. I''m not crazy about the processing. It looks a little flat. Maybe too much High Pass?</td>', 'Lovely composition. I''m not crazy about the processing. It looks a little flat. Maybe too much High Pass?', '2007-09-29 14:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124404, 591569, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful animal. Too bad about the background/setting.</td>', 'Beautiful animal. Too bad about the background/setting.', '2007-09-29 14:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124406, 591802, 66384, '<td valign="top">The tone gives it a nice historical look.</td>', 'The tone gives it a nice historical look.', '2007-09-29 14:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124415, 590433, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp. The white is a little blown on the head and throat. I like the DOF.</td>', 'Nice and sharp. The white is a little blown on the head and throat. I like the DOF.', '2007-09-29 14:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124416, 590617, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''d call this SSSSsssssssssssizzle!</td>', 'Wow, I''d call this SSSSsssssssssssizzle!', '2007-09-29 14:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124424, 591783, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think if you could have moved a little to the right, the composition would have been improved. The tree behind the bill is not so good, IMO. Also a shallower DOF might improve the background. Nice feather detail though.</td>', 'I think if you could have moved a little to the right, the composition would have been improved. The tree behind the bill is not so good, IMO. Also a shallower DOF might improve the background. Nice feather detail though.', '2007-09-29 14:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124429, 589754, 66384, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why you have the berries out of focus when they are the subject. Also I think the cherries need more light on them.</td>', 'I don''t understand why you have the berries out of focus when they are the subject. Also I think the cherries need more light on them.', '2007-09-29 14:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124437, 590816, 66384, '<td valign="top">The highlights are a little blown on the back. I like the composition, but I would like to see more feather detail and less background mud.</td>', 'The highlights are a little blown on the back. I like the composition, but I would like to see more feather detail and less background mud.', '2007-09-29 14:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124438, 591449, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery, great photo</td>', 'Beautiful scenery, great photo', '2007-09-29 14:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124439, 591759, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more contrast in this image. And I''d like to see where the path is taking me. The way it is, it just takes me up and out of the image.</td>', 'I''d like to see more contrast in this image. And I''d like to see where the path is taking me. The way it is, it just takes me up and out of the image.', '2007-09-29 14:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124440, 591230, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual angle of this shot.</td>', 'I like the unusual angle of this shot.', '2007-09-29 14:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124442, 591818, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think this would be more effective without the barrier in the foreground. Also the horizon could use a little straightening. Nice subject for "S".</td>', 'I think this would be more effective without the barrier in the foreground. Also the horizon could use a little straightening. Nice subject for "S".', '2007-09-29 14:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124447, 591542, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color anyway. And great DOF and contrast.</td>', 'Beautiful color anyway. And great DOF and contrast.', '2007-09-29 14:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4124453, 590257, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great subject, simplicity, and light. I think the pole in the center foreground really hurts the image as it divides the picture in half and breaks the curve.</td>', 'Great subject, simplicity, and light. I think the pole in the center foreground really hurts the image as it divides the picture in half and breaks the curve.', '2007-09-29 14:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
