(4124463, 590684, 66384, '<td valign="top">Good photo for a "9" challenge. ;P The line leads my eye off to those rocks, and the focus on them seems a little soft. I find it frustrating, and it makes me blink and strain my eyes. Beautiful place though and I love the sky.</td>', 'Good photo for a "9" challenge. ;P The line leads my eye off to those rocks, and the focus on them seems a little soft. I find it frustrating, and it makes me blink and strain my eyes. Beautiful place though and I love the sky.', '2007-09-29 14:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
