(4124467, 590597, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. It forces me to stop and spend some time with this image and this woman.</td>', 'I like this a lot. It forces me to stop and spend some time with this image and this woman.', '2007-09-29 14:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
