(4125803, 591205, 7786, '<td valign="top">Its a good exposure, with a clear s-curve. If you used all the 640 pixels available to you it would do better. It makes a big difference.</td>', 'Its a good exposure, with a clear s-curve. If you used all the 640 pixels available to you it would do better. It makes a big difference.', '2007-09-30 11:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125812, 591643, 7786, '<td valign="top">Well exposed, well composed, excellent reflection and with a good clear S-curve. The only thing that I can criticize is that it over sharpened. Over sharpening is most clearly visible as a halo around dark items where they meet a bright background (or vise versa). In your picture this can be seen as a halo around tree branches and flower stalks where the meet the bright sky reflection.</td>', 'Well exposed, well composed, excellent reflection and with a good clear S-curve. The only thing that I can criticize is that it over sharpened. Over sharpening is most clearly visible as a halo around dark items where they meet a bright background (or vise versa). In your picture this can be seen as a halo around tree branches and flower stalks where the meet the bright sky reflection.', '2007-09-30 11:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125813, 591710, 70000, '<td valign="top">This could use deeper shaddows I think. It all seems kind of washed out</td>', 'This could use deeper shaddows I think. It all seems kind of washed out', '2007-09-30 11:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4125815, 591799, 70000, '<td valign="top">elegant, simple, beautifully lit, s curve....you got a grade rating from me. only thing is the blown out tip which I think takes a way a bit but still, very well done</td>', 'elegant, simple, beautifully lit, s curve....you got a grade rating from me. only thing is the blown out tip which I think takes a way a bit but still, very well done', '2007-09-30 11:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
