(4135252, 590122, 30049, '<td valign="top">THIS is what a ''S'' curve should look like.  :)  The lines lead to the primary subject and take the viewer thru the image.  Hooray!<br/> <br/>As for the image, I like the way the trees are forming a natural frame/tunnel for the train to come thru.  Keeps the viewers focused and in a natural place as well (train is close to the upper ROT point).<br/> <br/>Would be a tad stronger if the train was sharply focused instead of the tracks, but nonetheless I still like it overall.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'THIS is what a ''S'' curve should look like.  :)  The lines lead to the primary subject and take the viewer thru the image.  Hooray! As for the image, I like the way the trees are forming a natural frame/tunnel for the train to come thru.  Keeps the viewers focused and in a natural place as well (train is close to the upper ROT point). Would be a tad stronger if the train was sharply focused instead of the tracks, but nonetheless I still like it overall.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-10-02 23:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
