(4136149, 590449, 72252, '<td valign="top">I wish I could say that I found the comments constructive, [REDACTED].  Comments such as it''s blury, is it shot through a Chinese restaurant window, not lovin the comp, albiet entertaing statements are of no constructive value.<br/>I realize I''m not the best photog. around, it''s not my first calling and I do intend to get better at it... hopefully the comments will strive to do so as well. I hope I haven''t struck upon a popularity contest here. Thank You;<br/>Very Sincerely<br/>Frank Ertl<br/><br/><i>Message edited by L2 - Edited -- Calling out a Commenter.</i></td>', 'I wish I could say that I found the comments constructive, [REDACTED].  Comments such as it''s blury, is it shot through a Chinese restaurant window, not lovin the comp, albiet entertaing statements are of no constructive value.I realize I''m not the best photog. around, it''s not my first calling and I do intend to get better at it... hopefully the comments will strive to do so as well. I hope I haven''t struck upon a popularity contest here. Thank You;Very SincerelyFrank ErtlMessage edited by L2 - Edited -- Calling out a Commenter.', '2007-10-03 04:17:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136159, 591723, 68035, '<td valign="top">Karen....Doing a happy dance for you here.  Glad I was not the only person that noticed the reverse sign but also delighted that people recognised this for the wonderful image that it is.  Brilliant!!!!</td>', 'Karen....Doing a happy dance for you here.  Glad I was not the only person that noticed the reverse sign but also delighted that people recognised this for the wonderful image that it is.  Brilliant!!!!', '2007-10-03 04:24:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4136179, 591363, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ron<br/> <br/>Congrats on your second highest score!  Inspired by Nitsche maybe but delivered impeccably by you!  This was one of a few stand out shots for me in the challenge.  Part of the beauty is in the way you have made what must have been quite a tricky set up look so simple and minimalist<br/> <br/>Love the way you have kept the tape spool so tight and that there are no blemishes on the s -curve<br/> <br/>Terrific job, many congratulations</td>', 'Ron Congrats on your second highest score!  Inspired by Nitsche maybe but delivered impeccably by you!  This was one of a few stand out shots for me in the challenge.  Part of the beauty is in the way you have made what must have been quite a tricky set up look so simple and minimalist Love the way you have kept the tape spool so tight and that there are no blemishes on the s -curve Terrific job, many congratulations', '2007-10-03 04:46:34.000000', NULL, 0),
