(4139482, 591162, 61651, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s got a bead on you - very good capture of an s.  Looks to me like you focused past a leaf or somesuch that was nearer your lens, which caused the obscured bit on the front of its head, not that your focus was off.  If my guess about that is right, a wider aperture may have given you a clearer view of his snout.</td>', 'Looks like he''s got a bead on you - very good capture of an s.  Looks to me like you focused past a leaf or somesuch that was nearer your lens, which caused the obscured bit on the front of its head, not that your focus was off.  If my guess about that is right, a wider aperture may have given you a clearer view of his snout.', '2007-10-03 23:15:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4139504, 591713, 61651, '<td valign="top">It''s a subtle s, and backwards to boot, but it is there.  Nice saturation in this shot - all those yellow flares punctuated by little black puffballs.  Have fun with that lens!</td>', 'It''s a subtle s, and backwards to boot, but it is there.  Nice saturation in this shot - all those yellow flares punctuated by little black puffballs.  Have fun with that lens!', '2007-10-03 23:19:27.000000', NULL, 0),
