(4140122, 591390, 61788, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for comments and voting this high :) I agree, I needed more work to make it brighter - my bad. Though I positioned curve not in the center purposely - didn''t want to have is as the most important part of composition.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for comments and voting this high :) I agree, I needed more work to make it brighter - my bad. Though I positioned curve not in the center purposely - didn''t want to have is as the most important part of composition.', '2007-10-04 04:15:51.000000', NULL, 0),
