(4140654, 590664, 56797, '<td valign="top">oh this is a great location/road. I bet if you could have gotten higher, say stood on a car or something to get the whole curve of the road without the railing blockign it it would look way cooler.</td>', 'oh this is a great location/road. I bet if you could have gotten higher, say stood on a car or something to get the whole curve of the road without the railing blockign it it would look way cooler.', '2007-10-04 10:18:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4140698, 591811, 74605, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Your composition is great and the dof excellent.  The colors here are wonderful for the subject!  Well done.</td>', 'Nice image.  Your composition is great and the dof excellent.  The colors here are wonderful for the subject!  Well done.', '2007-10-04 10:40:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4140767, 591479, 84363, '<td valign="top">Well this being my first challenge on DPC I am pleased with where this ended up.  Thank you to everyone for the great comments.  Using the large ''S'' at the end I was hoping to lead your imagination through the image.  Now I realize this may not have been the best photo for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Creature - as far as not picking up the reflections in the paint...  You''re right a good polarizer works wonders.  Also the best way to take car photos is to make sure you have cloud cover.  When I took this photo the sky was pretty much clear except for a 4 or 5 minute window where one stray cloud was passing over...<br/> <br/></td>', 'Well this being my first challenge on DPC I am pleased with where this ended up.  Thank you to everyone for the great comments.  Using the large ''S'' at the end I was hoping to lead your imagination through the image.  Now I realize this may not have been the best photo for this challenge. Creature - as far as not picking up the reflections in the paint...  You''re right a good polarizer works wonders.  Also the best way to take car photos is to make sure you have cloud cover.  When I took this photo the sky was pretty much clear except for a 4 or 5 minute window where one stray cloud was passing over... ', '2007-10-04 11:13:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4140774, 591736, 14986, '<td valign="top">It''s so nice to have a photograph that fits the challenge well, and yet could easily stand on its own outside of the theme.  This is really well seen and photographed (and edited.)  The lighting and composition make this scene stand out.<br/> <br/>Although some of the clever photo set ups, studio shots, and heavily edited stuff at DPC is still good photography - this is more the style I like and it''s nice to see it get the blue!</td>', 'It''s so nice to have a photograph that fits the challenge well, and yet could easily stand on its own outside of the theme.  This is really well seen and photographed (and edited.)  The lighting and composition make this scene stand out. Although some of the clever photo set ups, studio shots, and heavily edited stuff at DPC is still good photography - this is more the style I like and it''s nice to see it get the blue!', '2007-10-04 11:16:06.000000', NULL, 0),
