(4141475, 590617, 84981, '<td valign="top">This is by far one of the coolest pictures I have ever seen. I have always wanted to take a picture like this.I really like how some of the cars are transparent and then most of them you can see. I also really like how the picture is half headlights and half tail lights.</td>', 'This is by far one of the coolest pictures I have ever seen. I have always wanted to take a picture like this.I really like how some of the cars are transparent and then most of them you can see. I also really like how the picture is half headlights and half tail lights.', '2007-10-04 16:16:01.000000', NULL, 0),
