(5295396, 591509, 37252, '<td valign="top">What lovely landscape you have in Ireland.</td>', 'What lovely landscape you have in Ireland.', '2009-03-08 04:05:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5899845, 591649, 111441, '<td valign="top">you should have taken it from the other side so it would make a "S" but great action shot</td>', 'you should have taken it from the other side so it would make a "S" but great action shot', '2010-03-11 11:00:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6118383, 591805, 40718, '<td valign="top">In my own photography I am only just learning that small human elements add greatly to an image.  I don''t know if you posed the person with the bag at the end, but it just adds.  First the leading lines and curves draw the eye, but second, it gives us a human counterbalance to the modern architecture.</td>', 'In my own photography I am only just learning that small human elements add greatly to an image.  I don''t know if you posed the person with the bag at the end, but it just adds.  First the leading lines and curves draw the eye, but second, it gives us a human counterbalance to the modern architecture.', '2010-08-04 21:02:56.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
